# WS2-03/WS2-05. # Sources: spec/03-ownership.md §3 (moves; a moved value is never dropped), §5 (drop order: locals in reverse declaration order, struct fields in declaration order, array elements first to last, parameters after the body locals; drops on every return/break/continue; exactly once), spec/04-expressions.md §3 (temporaries drop at statement end in reverse creation order).
 The condition's temporary tok(i + 50) drops at the end of the
# if-condition statement, before break leaves the body; t drops at break.
profiles: host
with: tok.clo
expect: output
contrast: == 51 ==> == 52
contrast-expect: output
--- output
drop 50
drop 0
drop 51
drop 1
end
--- contrast-output
drop 50
drop 0
drop 51
drop 1
drop 52
drop 2
end
